<title>UK: UBS adds BT, RWE Zeneca and ABB to focus list.</title>
<headline>UBS adds BT, RWE Zeneca and ABB to focus list.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS said on Monday it was adding ABB AG, British Telecom, RWE and Zeneca to its European focus list.</p>
<p>In its latest European strategy quarterly, UBS said the stocks would replace Burton Group Plc, Enterprise Oil, Grand Met, Marks and Spencer and P&amp;O.</p>
